  50:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_file_create.c **** /*    This function first attempts to find the specified file.  If found, */
  51:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_file_create.c **** /*    the create request is invalid and an error is returned to the       */
  52:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_file_create.c **** /*    caller.  After the file name verification is made, a search for a   */
  53:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_file_create.c **** /*    free directory entry will be made.  If nothing is available, an     */
  54:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_file_create.c **** /*    error will be returned to the caller.  Otherwise, if all is okay, a */
  55:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_file_create.c **** /*    file of 0 bytes will be created.                                    */
  56:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_file_create.c **** /*                                                                        */
